1</a></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;">Accounts have=
 a recovery status when a user requests a password reset or an admin initia=
tes one on their behalf.</span></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <h4 id=3D"UserManagement-9"><strong>9</strong></h4></td>
