    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">User Sync Process</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;">Accounts have=
 a password expired status when the password has expired and the account re=
quires an update to the password before a user is granted access to applica=
tions.</span></td>
   </tr>
