    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">User Sync Process</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;">Accounts have=
 a locked out status when the user exceeds the number of login attempts def=
ined in the login policy.</span></td>
