ser+Configuration+API#UserConfigurationAPI-U5">User Configuration API#U5</a=
></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;">Accounts have=
 a deprovisioned status when an admin explicitly deactivates or deprovision=
s them. All application assignments are removed and the password is permane=
ntly deleted.</span></td>
